%% F086 / F087 簽核階段流程：核准 → ready / 拒絕 → personnel_ratio + banner 觸發
%% 對應 E07 重構批次 6（2026-05-15）
flowchart TD
    Start([名單 stage = 'approval']) --> ViewSummary[部長 / Admin 透過 F088 GET<br/>summary/listNo 預覽完整摘要]
    ViewSummary --> Decision{部長 / Admin<br/>決策}

    Decision -->|核准| ApproveModal[F086 核准確認對話框<br/>顯示名單名稱 + Rollback 提示]
    Decision -->|拒絕| RejectModal[F087 拒絕對話框<br/>填寫拒絕原因 1~500 字必填]

    ApproveModal -->|確認核准| ApprovePreCheck{F086 後端前置檢查<br/>DirectorGuard +<br/>assertStageEquals approval +<br/>歷史月份 + 月跑鎖}
    RejectModal -->|確認拒絕| RejectPreCheck{F087 後端前置檢查<br/>DirectorGuard +<br/>assertStageEquals approval +<br/>歷史月份 + 月跑鎖 +<br/>rejectReason 校驗}

    ApprovePreCheck -->|處長| Reject403A[403<br/>E07_FORBIDDEN_DIRECTOR_ONLY]
    ApprovePreCheck -->|stage 不符| Reject422A[422<br/>APPROVAL_INVALID_STAGE]
    ApprovePreCheck -->|月跑中| Reject409A[409<br/>ASSIGNMENT_RUN_ALREADY_RUNNING]
    ApprovePreCheck -->|歷史月份| Reject403H[403<br/>LIST_HISTORICAL_READONLY]

    RejectPreCheck -->|處長| Reject403R[403<br/>E07_FORBIDDEN_DIRECTOR_ONLY]
    RejectPreCheck -->|stage 不符| Reject422R[422<br/>APPROVAL_INVALID_STAGE]
    RejectPreCheck -->|拒絕原因為空| Reject422Empty[422<br/>APPROVAL_REJECT_REASON_REQUIRED]
    RejectPreCheck -->|拒絕原因 > 500 字| Reject422Long[422<br/>APPROVAL_REJECT_REASON_TOO_LONG]
    RejectPreCheck -->|月跑中| Reject409R[409<br/>ASSIGNMENT_RUN_ALREADY_RUNNING]
    RejectPreCheck -->|歷史月份| Reject403HR[403<br/>LIST_HISTORICAL_READONLY]

    ApprovePreCheck -->|通過| ApproveTxn[F086 DB Transaction<br/>1. UPDATE stage = 'ready'<br/>2. INSERT assignment_approval<br/>   action = 'approve'<br/>3. INSERT assignment_audit_log<br/>   action = 'APPROVE_STAGE']
    RejectPreCheck -->|通過| RejectTxn[F087 DB Transaction<br/>1. UPDATE stage = 'personnel_ratio'<br/>2. DELETE FROM ob_empl_set<br/>   WHERE list_no 跨轄區清空<br/>3. INSERT assignment_approval<br/>   action = 'reject' + reject_reason<br/>4. INSERT assignment_audit_log<br/>   action = 'REJECT_STAGE']

    ApproveTxn --> ApproveSuccess([名單進入<br/>stage = 'ready'<br/>出現於 F088 ready 清單<br/>F061 月跑可用])
    RejectTxn --> RejectSuccess([名單退回<br/>stage = 'personnel_ratio'<br/>個別業務比例已清空<br/>處長需重新設定])

    RejectSuccess --> BannerTrigger[/F087 BR-11<br/>banner 觸發機制：<br/>F082 GET response<br/>latestRejection 欄位/]
    BannerTrigger --> F082Banner[/F082 v1.1 §7.x<br/>banner 渲染：<br/>頁首主動顯示拒絕原因<br/>可關閉 / 可折疊/]

    ApproveSuccess -.後續 F089 Rollback.-> RollbackPath[F089 退回簽核<br/>清空 assignment_approval<br/>設定資料保留]
    RollbackPath -.-> Start

    classDef successPath fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745,color:#000
    classDef rejectPath fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#dc3545,color:#000
    classDef errorPath fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#ffc107,color:#000
    classDef bannerPath fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#007bff,color:#000

    class ApproveSuccess,ApproveTxn successPath
    class RejectSuccess,RejectTxn rejectPath
    class Reject403A,Reject422A,Reject409A,Reject403H,Reject403R,Reject422R,Reject422Empty,Reject422Long,Reject409R,Reject403HR errorPath
    class BannerTrigger,F082Banner bannerPath
